{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2021-12-06 14:00:00', 'title': 'PG&E SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, GENERATION AND CHIEF NUCLEAR OFFICER JIM WELSCH TO RETIRE', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--JAMES [JIM] M. WELSCH, SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, GENERATION AND CHIEF NUCLEAR OFFICER (CNO) FOR PACIFIC GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANY (PG&E), HAS NOTIFIED THE COMPANY OF HIS INTENTION TO RETIRE DECEMBER 31, 2021 AFTER 37 YEARS OF SERVICE. "JIM HAS DONE AN OUTSTANDING JOB LEADING OUR NUCLEAR AND POWER GENERATION OPERATIONS, ELEVATING OUR DIABLO CANYON POWER PLANT TO A BEST-IN-CLASS NUCLEAR FACILITY. WE\'RE GOING TO MISS HIS CONTRIBUTIONS AND ARE GRATEFUL FOR HIS SERVIC'}